Start: "Start here · Admitted ordinary copy\nChecked root identity + native application type" {class: start}
Layout: "First present checked layout\nContents / Support Files / Resources / flat\nOnly checked absence advances"
Info: "Platform then plain information\nFirst present healthy dictionary authoritative\nRefusal withholds its own facts"
Direct: "Complete direct lproj inventory\nLiteral parent-bounded components\nExplicit job preferences; no language subset"
Bases: "Base-first name plan\nGlobal then exact selected / Base / development\nFour strings and loctable families per base"
