Candidate: "Dictionary display before name\nFirst usable candidate wins\nHealthy empty advances; refusal stops name fallback"
Partial: "Individual object/file refusal\nRetain admitted identity / location / choice\nAffected metadata unknown; diagnostics"
Shared: "Shared count / call / gross / deadline failure\nWhole population FAILED / null\nNo native-order prefix"
Retire: "Final scalars only; retire on true return\nDispose borrowed dependencies before buffer reuse\nTwo root walks; bracketed identity"
Boundary: "Semantic plan checked; k215 hold remains\nNext: complete cost certificate and family reconciliation\nWhole-producer review + native G/N/V pending"
